    "name": "taCam",
    "steam_appid": 3250210,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250210/extras/383e1f9fb9737eab0ab3883ec8020b76.avif?t=1739277278\" data-has-big width=800 height=90 /></span><strong>taCam</strong> is an action-packed, tactical multiplayer first-person shooter that immerses players in a bodycam-style perspective, offering unparalleled realism and situational awareness. Designed for players who value strategic depth and fluid gunplay, <strong>taCam</strong> challenges you to think tactically, whether you're clearing rooms, coordinating with teammates, or flanking enemies. The bodycam perspective enhances the sense of urgency and realism, replicating the restricted and dynamic views used by real-world operatives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250210/extras/d1c9fcf5f5731f92884119dd610a5a04.avif?t=1739277278\" data-has-big width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With seamless gunplay mechanics like ADS reloading, point shooting, and weapon blocking, every movement and decision feels intuitive, creating a smooth combat flow. The bodycam view further enhances immersion, making every firefight feel intensely personal and realistic. Customization is key\u2014players can modify their loadouts with an intuitive system to adapt their arsenal to the battlefield's demands, and the <strong>Map Vote System</strong> gives players control over the next map and mode, ensuring a dynamic experience every round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250210/extras/fb3666c5074658060fb3f0d20bc93bbd.avif?t=1739277278\" data-has-big width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound design plays a pivotal role in <strong>taCam</strong>, with a <strong>Distance-Based Gunshot System</strong> that adjusts the soundscape based on your position, heightening the realism of each encounter. Players can also engage with adaptive AI in co-op modes or battle it out in multiplayer modes such as <strong>Skirmish</strong>, <strong>Team Deathmatch</strong>, and <strong>Gun Game</strong>. Each mode requires strategic teamwork and sharp reflexes, making <strong>taCam</strong> a challenging and engaging experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250210/extras/7daf4aa73045d7ffb2c5c15b1c1eaf43.avif?t=1739277278\" data-has-big width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're outwitting human opponents or adapting to the AI\u2019s evolving tactics, <strong>taCam</strong> delivers a fast-paced, tactical shooter experience where every decision matters. Get ready to engage in one of the most immersive, bodycam-style tactical shooters available!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250210/extras/383e1f9fb9737eab0ab3883ec8020b76.avif?t=1739277278\" data-has-big width=800 height=90 /></span><strong>taCam</strong> is an action-packed, tactical multiplayer first-person shooter that immerses players in a bodycam-style perspective, offering unparalleled realism and situational awareness. Designed for players who value strategic depth and fluid gunplay, <strong>taCam</strong> challenges you to think tactically, whether you're clearing rooms, coordinating with teammates, or flanking enemies. The bodycam perspective enhances the sense of urgency and realism, replicating the restricted and dynamic views used by real-world operatives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250210/extras/d1c9fcf5f5731f92884119dd610a5a04.avif?t=1739277278\" data-has-big width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With seamless gunplay mechanics like ADS reloading, point shooting, and weapon blocking, every movement and decision feels intuitive, creating a smooth combat flow. The bodycam view further enhances immersion, making every firefight feel intensely personal and realistic. Customization is key\u2014players can modify their loadouts with an intuitive system to adapt their arsenal to the battlefield's demands, and the <strong>Map Vote System</strong> gives players control over the next map and mode, ensuring a dynamic experience every round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250210/extras/fb3666c5074658060fb3f0d20bc93bbd.avif?t=1739277278\" data-has-big width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound design plays a pivotal role in <strong>taCam</strong>, with a <strong>Distance-Based Gunshot System</strong> that adjusts the soundscape based on your position, heightening the realism of each encounter. Players can also engage with adaptive AI in co-op modes or battle it out in multiplayer modes such as <strong>Skirmish</strong>, <strong>Team Deathmatch</strong>, and <strong>Gun Game</strong>. Each mode requires strategic teamwork and sharp reflexes, making <strong>taCam</strong> a challenging and engaging experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250210/extras/7daf4aa73045d7ffb2c5c15b1c1eaf43.avif?t=1739277278\" data-has-big width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're outwitting human opponents or adapting to the AI\u2019s evolving tactics, <strong>taCam</strong> delivers a fast-paced, tactical shooter experience where every decision matters. Get ready to engage in one of the most immersive, bodycam-style tactical shooters available!</p>",
